ic-09 | Integrated voice, observed context activity and grounded research

Workstream ID: ic-09
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/Intercom/issues/8
Status: DONE (bounded implementation and technical qualification only; owner acceptance failed)
Milestone: Runnable integrated local candidate
Dependencies: ic-06, ic-08

Purpose:
  Close the feasible source-to-product gaps identified in the owner-reviewed
  vision/reality report without inventing agent telemetry or bypassing permissions.

Tasks:
  [x] Emit source-read metadata from the actual research worker and expose a
      correlated, bounded activity trail and finite graph pulses.
  [x] Support evidence-grounded synthesis through an explicitly selected
      existing idle session, retaining manual tool permissions and provenance.
  [x] Improve local speech responsiveness with reusable native recognition;
      preserve full-input final recognition, cancellation and five-minute review.
  [x] Verify normal, unavailable, partial, busy, cancellation and late-result
      behavior with disposable profiles and consented local audio.
  [x] Package the latest unsigned candidate; retain one release executable
      after exact candidate verification, without restarting the owner's app.

Acceptance criteria:
  Actual research reads, failed checks and job/tool locations stay distinct.
  The graph never loops guessed real traversal or turns proposals into evidence.
  Research output distinguishes local extracts from Copilot synthesis and
  independently verified work. Session selection never guesses an idle target.
  Audio remains on-device. No test creates/resumes a real work session, enables
  blanket approvals, records the physical microphone or touches owner app state.
  The resulting executable includes the integrated source; old executable
  cleanup is exact-path scoped and separate from promotion/restart/publication.

Completion evidence:
  OWNER ASSESSMENT, 2026-11-13: the overall experience was rejected and
  implementation paused. A live .18 work request stopped on unsupported
  concurrent tool-permission requests with unknown outcome. The bounded
  technical completion below does not establish a usable end-to-end product.
  ic06/ic07 remain incomplete; see TODO/03_DEVELOPMENT_LEDGER.todo for the
  public accountability record. Source publication is not a fix or release.
  Final lint/build,19renderer,57host,11controller and53disposable desktop
  cases pass. Eight focused packaged desktop cases and actual portable smoke
  pass: fresh defaults, local synthetic speech, X/Y exclusion preservation,
  live drafts/final, same native PID reuse, controls and helper shutdown.
  Voice suite50/51: legacy Windows confuses synthetic "please" with "police";
  strict content assertion retained, bundled Vulkan qualified separately.
  Actual research-worker progress, unavailable/partial sources, exact idle
  selection, duplicate ownership, cancellation/late results, malformed
  synthesis/citations and browser failure are covered. A synthetic integrated
  trial crosses actual collection, natural intent, ordinary queue and report.
  .16 EXE631115985bytes, SHA256:
  4c8d433b1bc1d6bab7b8a36943fedcfa4e048819ca8d5fa1f51534bd8af1a00e.
  All21project runtime/renderer files,eight speech files,13notices, native
  dependency and private-file exclusions verified. One EXE plus checksum
  remains after exact-path old/intermediate cleanup; no running app touched.
  Human multilingual/natural-five-minute accuracy, generic GPU distribution,
  controlled speed/RAM and real multi-session acceptance remain unqualified.
  Citation locations are validated, not semantic truth. No new real session
  prompt, physical mic, audible playback or remote release in this milestone.

Completion log:
  2026-11-13: Owner explicitly reported disappointment and paused Intercom.
  Retain earlier implementation evidence, but do not describe it as accepted
  delivery. Record the failure publicly and publish source only as requested.
  2026-11-12: Completed the bounded integrated local .16 candidate. Warm
  private-pipe speech, actual source-read trail/finite pulses and explicit
  cited synthesis are packaged together. Qualification does not establish
  owner acceptance or full-product completion; ic05/ic06 remain active.
  Owner approved all feasible vision-report items, autonomous implementation,
  and keeping only the latest local release file. No remote publication,
  arbitrary real-session testing or interruption of the running app is inferred.
